{"seq":2,"slug":"authorized-channel-price-tiers","title":"授权渠道体系与价格梯度模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/brand-map-channel-price-enforcement/map-policy-channel/authorized-channel-price-tiers","wordCount":2962,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"授权渠道体系与价格梯度模型\">授权渠道体系与价格梯度模型</h1><p>同一个 SKU 在品牌自营旗舰店标 1299 元、在天猫授权专卖店标 1199 元、在抖音授权店铺标 1099 元、在某个未授权的拼多多店铺标 699 元——这四个数字背后是三件事的叠加：谁被授权、被授权到哪一档、以及那一档的价格下限落在哪里。品牌建立最低广告价（MAP）体系时最常见的第一类错误，就是不先定义渠道梯度就下发统一最低价，结果把高服务投入的线下渠道和低成本的线上渠道塞进同一个价格笼子。本文讲的就是这套<strong>授权层级 → 价格梯度 → 最低价下界</strong>的映射模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-授权体系是价格梯度的先行条件\">核心概念：授权体系是价格梯度的先行条件</h2><p>价格梯度不能先于授权体系存在。最低广告价在美国是品牌<strong>单方面</strong>的广告政策（unilateral policy），其可执行性恰恰依赖「谁被授权、谁未被授权」这条边界：品牌可以单方面停止向违反 MAP 的<strong>授权经销商</strong>供货，但若与<strong>非授权转售者</strong>之间不存在合同关系，就没有可直接主张的约束。这就把渠道分层变成了 MAP 机制的地基。美国联邦最高法院在 <em>Leegin Creative Leather Products v. PSKS</em>（2007）中推翻了「转售价格维持（RPM）本身违法」的百年判例，转为按合理原则审查（<a href=\"https://supreme.justia.com/cases/federal/us/551/877/\">Supreme Court, 551 U.S. 877</a>），为品牌用价格政策管理经销网络打开了空间，但也意味着政策的可执行性完全取决于你与谁有可直接主张的关系。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>一个跨境品牌在 2026 年的渠道形态通常有七类并存，每一类的成本结构、服务投入与价格承受力都不同：</th>\n<th>渠道类别</th>\n<th>典型形态</th>\n<th>服务投入</th>\n<th>价格下限通常位置</th>\n<th>MAP 可执行性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>品牌自营</td>\n<td>官方旗舰店 / DTC 官网</td>\n<td>最高（内容、售后、体验）</td>\n<td>基准价（list price）</td>\n<td>内控，非政策</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>授权直营经销商</td>\n<td>授权专卖店、区域代理</td>\n<td>高（陈列、售前、安装）</td>\n<td>贴近基准价</td>\n<td>强（有合同）</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>授权线上专营店</td>\n<td>平台品牌旗舰/专营店</td>\n<td>中（运营、投流）</td>\n<td>基准价 −5% 至 −12%</td>\n<td>强（有合同）</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>授权平台分销</td>\n<td>平台自营采购（1P）</td>\n<td>中低</td>\n<td>平台自定，常破价</td>\n<td>弱（平台议价权）</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>授权线下零售</td>\n<td>连锁商超、门店</td>\n<td>高（场地、人力）</td>\n<td>与线上接近</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会员/员工渠道</td>\n<td>内购、福利平台</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>显著低于基准价</td>\n<td>需独立封闭运行</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未授权转售</td>\n<td>灰产店铺、代购</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无下限</td>\n<td>无直接合同</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的工程含义是：<strong>价格梯度必须与授权层级一一对应，并且每一档都要有可执行的约束机制</strong>。当一档渠道没有对应的合同约束时（典型是平台 1P 与未授权转售），它就不应被纳入「梯度」，而应当被当作「需要治理的偏离量」。\n统一最低价的致命伤是忽略了<strong>渠道成本差</strong>：一个线下授权店为达到陈列标准、提供到店体验与安装服务，每单可变成本可能比纯线上店高出十几个百分点；两档下限若相同，线下渠道要么违反 MAP 自保，要么退出授权。梯度模型让「服务投入」与「价格空间」正相关，使每一档都有理由留在体系内。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[品牌定价基准 list price] --&gt; B{渠道是否被授权}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C[未授权转售&lt;br/&gt;无合同约束]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| D[授权层级判定]&#10;  D --&gt; E[自营 / 直营经销商&lt;br/&gt;下限贴近基准]&#10;  D --&gt; F[授权线上专营&lt;br/&gt;下限小幅下浮]&#10;  D --&gt; G[授权平台分销 1P&lt;br/&gt;平台议价 弱约束]&#10;  D --&gt; H[会员/员工封闭渠道&lt;br/&gt;独立价格池]&#10;  C --&gt; I[监控 + 举证 + 通知/诉讼]&#10;  E --&gt; J[MAP 政策约束]&#10;  F --&gt; J&#10;  G --&gt; K[合同条款 + 年度谈判]&#10;  H --&gt; L[封闭运行 + 身份校验]\">graph TD\n  A[品牌定价基准 list price] --&gt; B{渠道是否被授权}\n  B --&gt;|否| C[未授权转售&lt;br/&gt;无合同约束]\n  B --&gt;|是| D[授权层级判定]\n  D --&gt; E[自营 / 直营经销商&lt;br/&gt;下限贴近基准]\n  D --&gt; F[授权线上专营&lt;br/&gt;下限小幅下浮]\n  D --&gt; G[授权平台分销 1P&lt;br/&gt;平台议价 弱约束]\n  D --&gt; H[会员/员工封闭渠道&lt;br/&gt;独立价格池]\n  C --&gt; I[监控 + 举证 + 通知/诉讼]\n  E --&gt; J[MAP 政策约束]\n  F --&gt; J\n  G --&gt; K[合同条款 + 年度谈判]\n  H --&gt; L[封闭运行 + 身份校验]</pre><h2 id=\"价格梯度的量化建模\">价格梯度的量化建模</h2><p>把梯度从口号变成可执行的东西，需要给每一档渠道定义一条<strong>价格下限函数</strong>，而不是一个孤立数字。结构化档位记录的字段包括：<code>base_price_ref</code>（指向 SKU 的基准价）、<code>max_tier_discount</code>（该档允许的最大折扣，梯度的核心旋钮，通常按渠道服务成本反推）、<code>map_floor_formula</code>（下限公式，让下限跟随基准价自动重算，避免每次调价手动改 N 个渠道配置）、<code>promo_exempt_windows</code> 与 <code>promo_exempt_floor_formula</code>（促销豁免窗口及更低的底价）、<code>coupon_stack_limit</code>（优惠券叠加上限，这是线上渠道最常用的绕开下限手段）、以及 <code>effective_from</code> 与 <code>source_ref</code>（生效日与合同出处）。MAP 政策普遍为特定促销窗口留出更低的豁免底价，但豁免必须有明确时间窗和更低的底价，否则等于取消了 MAP。</p>\n<h3 id=\"从基准价推导各档下限\">从基准价推导各档下限</h3><p>设基准价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，某档允许的最大折扣为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则该档的 MAP 下限与促销底价分别为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>floor</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msubsup><mi>P</mi><mtext>floor</mtext><mtext>promo</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>promo</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>promo</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{floor}}(t) = P_0 \\times (1 - d_t), \\qquad P_{\\text{floor}}^{\\text{promo}}(t) = P_0 \\times (1 - d_{\\text{promo}}), \\quad d_{\\text{promo}} &gt; d_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">floor</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0836em;vertical-align:-0.3013em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7823em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">floor</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">promo</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">promo</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">promo</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>一个真实约束是：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>promo</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{promo}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">promo</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不能低于渠道的进货成本率，否则促销期成交会击穿毛利，甚至低于经销商采购价，反过来催生窜货动机。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>promo</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{promo}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">promo</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的下界由「渠道成本率 + 最小可接受毛利」共同决定，而非由市场竞争压力单方面决定。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>渠道档</th>\n<th>最大折扣 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>促销豁免 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>promo</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{promo}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">promo</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>推导下限（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_0=1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span>）</th>\n<th>促销底价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>品牌自营</td>\n<td>0%</td>\n<td>20%</td>\n<td>1000</td>\n<td>800</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>授权直营经销商</td>\n<td>5%</td>\n<td>22%</td>\n<td>950</td>\n<td>780</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>授权线上专营店</td>\n<td>12%</td>\n<td>25%</td>\n<td>880</td>\n<td>750</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>授权线下零售</td>\n<td>8%</td>\n<td>20%</td>\n<td>920</td>\n<td>800</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会员封闭渠道</td>\n<td>30%</td>\n<td>30%</td>\n<td>700</td>\n<td>700</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表把「梯度」落成了可计算的矩阵：任意渠道的任何报价，都能被判定落在哪一档、是否在下限之上、是否处于合法豁免窗口。判定逻辑只有三步——解析渠道归属档位、读取当期有效折扣、比较报价与推导下限。这段判决必须在<strong>报价那一刻</strong>执行，而不是事后批量比对：渠道身份、促销窗口、SKU 基准价三者都随时间变化，把判定推迟到月度报表里，会让「当期违规」和「事后发现」之间出现一段谁都不负责的空窗。</p>\n<h2 id=\"授权身份与价格档位的绑定\">授权身份与价格档位的绑定</h2><p>梯度模型能否生效，取决于系统能不能回答「这个报价者属于哪一档」。授权身份因此不能是一份 Excel 名单，而必须是一个<strong>可被交易链路实时查询的主体标识</strong>。授权身份到价格档位之间有三层映射，任一层断裂都会导致判定失败：主体到授权合同（一个法人可签多份不同渠道的授权书，判定须落到「主体 + 渠道形态」的组合键）；合同到价格档位（合同写明的档位是下限来源，需处理到期、续签、临时授权，档位必须有生效期）；销售账号到法律主体（跨境最易出错的一层，价格判定需要的粒度是<strong>店铺 × 授权档位</strong>而非主体）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>映射层</th>\n<th>主键粒度</th>\n<th>常见断裂点</th>\n<th>处理手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主体 → 合同</td>\n<td>主体 × 渠道形态</td>\n<td>一主体多合同未拆分</td>\n<td>合同表以（主体, 渠道）为唯一键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合同 → 档位</td>\n<td>合同 × 生效期</td>\n<td>到期未下架档位</td>\n<td>档位带 effective_from/to，过期降为「无档」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账号 → 主体</td>\n<td>平台店铺 × 主体</td>\n<td>一店混营、代运营账号</td>\n<td>店铺级授权标记 + 商品级授权范围</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"判定链路\">判定链路</h3><p>一条报价要拿到自己的价格下限，必须依次通过三层解析；任何一层失败都落到「未知渠道」兜底档，按未授权处理。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[报价请求&lt;br/&gt;店铺 + SKU] --&gt; B[解析店铺归属主体]&#10;  B --&gt; C{主体-渠道&lt;br/&gt;合同存在?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D[未知渠道&lt;br/&gt;按未授权处理]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| E[读取当期档位]&#10;  E --&gt; F{档位在&lt;br/&gt;生效期内?}&#10;  F --&gt;|否| D&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[计算该档 MAP 下限]&#10;  G --&gt; H[判定报价是否合规]&#10;  H --&gt; I[合规: 放行]&#10;  H --&gt; J[违规: 通知 + 处置]\">graph TD\n  A[报价请求&lt;br/&gt;店铺 + SKU] --&gt; B[解析店铺归属主体]\n  B --&gt; C{主体-渠道&lt;br/&gt;合同存在?}\n  C --&gt;|否| D[未知渠道&lt;br/&gt;按未授权处理]\n  C --&gt;|是| E[读取当期档位]\n  E --&gt; F{档位在&lt;br/&gt;生效期内?}\n  F --&gt;|否| D\n  F --&gt;|是| G[计算该档 MAP 下限]\n  G --&gt; H[判定报价是否合规]\n  H --&gt; I[合规: 放行]\n  H --&gt; J[违规: 通知 + 处置]</pre><p>一个设计要点是<strong>降级要保守</strong>：身份解析失败时默认落到「无档位」，而不是「最宽松档位」。把解析失败当作宽松处理的系统，会立刻被灰产反向利用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平台-1p-与跨境的梯度特例\">平台 1P 与跨境的梯度特例</h2><p>梯度模型在跨境场景下有两个无法回避的特例，处理不好会直接击穿整个体系。</p>\n<h3 id=\"平台自营采购-1p-的议价现实\">平台自营采购（1P）的议价现实</h3><p>主流平台（亚马逊、京东自营等）以自营采购方式进货时，是品牌的<strong>客户</strong>而非<strong>渠道</strong>：平台自行决定零售价，品牌的价格政策对平台没有约束力，亚马逊的公开立场即是零售商自行定价（<a href=\"https://sellercentral.amazon.com/help/hub/reference/G5TUVJKZHUVMN77V\">Amazon Fair Pricing Policy</a>）。对 1P 渠道唯一可行的手段是<strong>合同条款 + 年度谈判</strong>：在供货合同里写入零售价区间或价格建议条款，并接受平台拥有最终定价权。把 1P 硬塞进 MAP 政策，只会得到一个执行不了、还在谈判桌上失分的条款。</p>\n<h3 id=\"跨境站点价差与汇率折损\">跨境站点价差与汇率折损</h3><p>同一商品在德国站、美国站、日本站的定价差异，若超过跨境物流与关税总成本，就会自动催生<strong>跨境套利与窜货</strong>：从低价站点批量采购、转售到高价站点。设两站点价格为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_a, P_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，跨境总成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，则安全条件为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>logistics</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>duty</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>compliance</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|P_a - P_b| &lt; C_{\\text{logistics}} + C_{\\text{duty}} + C_{\\text{compliance}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">logistics</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">duty</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">compliance</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>多币种定价的另一个隐患是汇率：当基准价以某种货币设定、其他站点按汇率折算时，汇率波动会让原本合规的站点报价滑出下限。稳健做法是把各站点的 MAP 下限以<strong>当地货币绝对金额</strong>固化并设季度重估周期，而非每次报价都做实时换算——实时换算会让下限在一天内反复变动，渠道无法据此稳定运营。</p>\n<h2 id=\"梯度政策的产品化落地\">梯度政策的产品化落地</h2><p>政策文本（MAP Policy）面向渠道，用自然语言说明「哪些渠道、在什么窗口、不得低于多少」；档位表（tier matrix）面向系统，以结构化数据提供判定输入。两者必须同源——政策文本里的每个数字都应能从档位表导出，否则一旦分叉，渠道看到的和系统判定用的就是两套规则。</p>\n<p>判定接口应是<strong>纯函数式</strong>的只读查询，输入（渠道身份, SKU, 报价, 时间点），输出（判定结论, 适用的下限, 适用规则来源）。三个关键点：<strong>只读</strong>（判定不改状态，避免把判断与处置耦合）、<strong>可追溯</strong>（输出带「下限来自哪条规则、哪个窗口」，这是争议与申诉的基础）、<strong>幂等</strong>（时间变量显式传入，而非内部读系统时钟）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>先授权、后梯度</strong>：价格梯度是授权体系的产物，不是它的替代。没有可执行合同关系的渠道，只能被当作需治理的偏离量。</li>\n<li><strong>梯度 = 逐档折扣上限</strong>：用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>floor</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{floor}}(t) = P_0 \\times (1 - d_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">floor</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 把每档价格空间显式化，并让下限跟随基准价自动重算。</li>\n<li><strong>促销豁免必须显式受限</strong>：豁免要有时间窗和更低的底价，否则等于取消 MAP；豁免底价下界由渠道成本率而非竞争压力决定。</li>\n<li><strong>身份判定要保守降级</strong>：身份解析失败时默认按未授权处理，绝不能落到最宽松档位。</li>\n<li><strong>平台 1P 走合同不走政策</strong>：1P 是品牌客户而非渠道，价格约束靠供货合同与年度谈判。</li>\n<li><strong>跨境价差要卡在履约成本之下</strong>：站点间价差超过跨境总成本就会催生套利与窜货。</li>\n<li><strong>三层分工不可混淆</strong>：政策与渠道定规则、监控负责发现、治理负责处置。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本篇只负责「给定报价，下限是多少」，不负责发现实际报价是否低于下限（监控层），也不负责违规后的处置（治理层）。同章另两篇分别处理政策文本的法律效力与执行边界，以及促销合规细则。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"授权渠道体系与价格梯度模型","id":"授权渠道体系与价格梯度模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：授权体系是价格梯度的先行条件","id":"核心概念-授权体系是价格梯度的先行条件"},{"level":2,"text":"价格梯度的量化建模","id":"价格梯度的量化建模"},{"level":3,"text":"从基准价推导各档下限","id":"从基准价推导各档下限"},{"level":2,"text":"授权身份与价格档位的绑定","id":"授权身份与价格档位的绑定"},{"level":3,"text":"判定链路","id":"判定链路"},{"level":2,"text":"平台 1P 与跨境的梯度特例","id":"平台-1p-与跨境的梯度特例"},{"level":3,"text":"平台自营采购（1P）的议价现实","id":"平台自营采购-1p-的议价现实"},{"level":3,"text":"跨境站点价差与汇率折损","id":"跨境站点价差与汇率折损"},{"level":2,"text":"梯度政策的产品化落地","id":"梯度政策的产品化落地"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"MAP 政策条款设计与法律边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/brand-map-channel-price-enforcement/map-policy-channel/map-policy-terms-legal-baseline"},"next":{"title":"MAP 协议签署、违约认定与处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/brand-map-channel-price-enforcement/map-policy-channel/map-agreement-breach-handling"}}